  "notes": [
    "**Decidir** is a regular **-IR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **decidido** (regular)",
    "Often followed by infinitive: *decidir hacer algo* (to decide to do something)",
    "Common usage: *Decidí quedarme* (I decided to stay), *No puedo decidir* (I can't decide)",
    "Related noun: **la decisión** (decision)",
    "Related adjective: **decidido/a** (determined, resolute)",
    "Expression: *estar decidido/a a* (to be determined to)"
